{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02881",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.9,
      "end_seconds": 4.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.1,
      "end_seconds": 10.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Alright, yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 15.94,
      "end_seconds": 18.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.19,
      "end_seconds": 24.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 25.69,
      "end_seconds": 30.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a severe headache. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.55,
      "end_seconds": 35.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.82,
      "end_seconds": 40.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Around a week, I think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 41.38,
      "end_seconds": 44.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "It was closer to two weeks, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.25,
      "end_seconds": 50.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly one to two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.47,
      "end_seconds": 53.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "That sounds about right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.9,
      "end_seconds": 63.22,
      "duration_seconds": 9.32,
      "text": "Sure. Alright, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.55,
      "end_seconds": 68.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "I'd say on and off. It's moderate, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.49,
      "end_seconds": 76.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 76.32,
      "end_seconds": 81.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.45,
      "end_seconds": 88.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "I was getting to that! Oh, and swollen face and hands."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.63,
      "end_seconds": 93.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.34,
      "end_seconds": 98.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Pretty severe, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.52,
      "end_seconds": 104.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Any vaginal bleeding, reduced baby movements or leaking fluid at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.53,
      "end_seconds": 120.42,
      "duration_seconds": 14.89,
      "text": "No, no vaginal bleeding, no reduced baby movements, no leaking fluid. I did have seeing flashing lights at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.73,
      "end_seconds": 123.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.49,
      "end_seconds": 129.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.17,
      "end_seconds": 133.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.56,
      "end_seconds": 139.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "My grandfather had a stroke. My mother has an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.5,
      "end_seconds": 157.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.92,
      "end_seconds": 162.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.62,
      "end_seconds": 165.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.82,
      "end_seconds": 169.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.76,
      "end_seconds": 173.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.13,
      "end_seconds": 182.4,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a small white one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.13,
      "end_seconds": 186.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.76,
      "end_seconds": 200.24,
      "duration_seconds": 13.48,
      "text": "For the anxiety, I believe. My wife sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. Foracort inhaler. I take it twice a day for my asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.5,
      "end_seconds": 205.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.64,
      "end_seconds": 219.98,
      "duration_seconds": 13.34,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.71,
      "end_seconds": 223.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.18,
      "end_seconds": 226.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Anxiety, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.22,
      "end_seconds": 227.92,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.26,
      "end_seconds": 234.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "I've had asthma for about ten years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.22,
      "end_seconds": 240.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Okay, I can see asthma in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.18,
      "end_seconds": 254.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.33,
      "end_seconds": 260.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Just part of my thyroid removed, years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 261.56,
      "end_seconds": 273.09,
      "duration_seconds": 11.53,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Blood pressure 158 over 92, respiratory rate 15, SpO2 97 percent on room air. Pulse is 90 beats a minute, temperature 36.6."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.84,
      "end_seconds": 277.54,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.91,
      "end_seconds": 283.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.03,
      "end_seconds": 286.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.86,
      "end_seconds": 302.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is very high and your reflexes are brisk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.03,
      "end_seconds": 315.64,
      "duration_seconds": 9.61,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with severe pre-eclampsia. A migraine is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.45,
      "end_seconds": 320.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.87,
      "end_seconds": 338.01,
      "duration_seconds": 15.14,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with severe pre-eclampsia do well once it's treated properly. Let me just check I've got this right. You've had a severe headache, moderate, and no leaking fluid or vaginal bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.82,
      "end_seconds": 341.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.71,
      "end_seconds": 351.55,
      "duration_seconds": 8.84,
      "text": "A urine protein test is what I'd like next, for pre-eclampsia. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.18,
      "end_seconds": 356.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.94,
      "end_seconds": 359.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}